From: Cameron Aaron <5474198+cameronaaron@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 23:20:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [bugfix] Pause Incognito media when returning to locked
 Incognito tabs

With "Lock Incognito tabs when you leave Chrome" enabled, media in
Incognito tabs kept playing behind the lock after returning to the app,
whether the lock screen or the regular tab model was shown. Suspend
controllable media sessions in Incognito tabs when the app is
foregrounded with a re-authentication pending, the same as the user
pressing pause, so playback can be resumed after unlocking.
